      "partial_coverage": "Preserve SINGLE_PEER_REFERENCE or PEER_BASKET state and separately label coverage_state=PARTIAL.",
      "zero_valid_symbols": "NO_QUOTED_PEER_SIGNAL"
    },
    "interpretation": "An equal-weight US peer-source return and research co-movement observation only. Do not convert it into HK signed return, prediction, probability, score, benefit/risk, or BUY decision.",
    "partial_coverage": "Compute and publish equal-weight observed mean over all available valid adopted unique symbols even when some declared members are missing; set coverage_state=PARTIAL and preserve missing-symbol list. The valid observations remain visible.",
    "weight": "Deduplicate by normalized US symbol per HK target + bucket; equal weight 1/N across available, valid, adopted unique symbols. Do not require a minimum breadth or complete quote coverage. Publish declared adopted unique count, valid quoted unique count, coverage, missing symbols/reasons, all adopted relation IDs, and per-symbol normalized weight."
